    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "can u go into more detail though? like, what are the specific scientific mechanisms or data points they usually point to? and also, what are the actual legal or philosophical frameworks the civil liberties side uses to back up their stance? i don't want it to just sound like \"they want freedom\" - i need the actual substance of their arguments.",
